# Gandalf, Goblins' Bane: Flameshape (the Adventure) exiles the top two cards of Bot1's library face down - a Mountain and a
# Lightning Bolt - "for as long as they remain exiled, you may play them if you control a Wizard". With no Wizard, the Bolt
# is not offered, though an untapped Mox Ruby could pay for it. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Gandalf, an Avatar Wizard, from its Adventure exile (CR 715.4); now it plays the
# exiled Mountain as its land and casts the exiled Bolt at Bot2. The Bolt is a noncreature spell: Gandalf gets +1/+1 and
# deals 1 damage to Bot2. Bot2 takes 3 + 1.

